                        "review": "[h1][Linux / SteamOS version review][/h1]\n\nFast-paced one button platformer. \nNice sounds and music, beautiful hand-drawn game!\nReally hard as devs say \"you will die a LOT\". RAGE QUIT guaranteed! \nAchievements is hard too (complete level without dying it's like joke)\nThis game is for players who loves hardcore platformers like  N++, Meatboy, 1001 Spikes, etc.\nLinux build played fast and smooth. Did't find any problems with perfomance too (played on laptop i3 2310m + nvidia 540M+ 8Gb RAM with installed Kubuntu 16.04) \nI recomend to buy this game!",
